		"description": "API collection for StreamKar Training Bot — covers both RAG (LangChain + OpenAI) and TF-IDF (scikit-learn) backends.\n\n**Ports:**\n- Local: RAG = 5000, TF-IDF = 5001\n- Docker: Use port 3000 with /api/rag/ or /api/tfidf/ prefix\n\n**Note:** Port changed from 8000 to 5000/5001 due to other projects running on the EC2 server.",
